      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "With the new changes now we see them everytime someone changes avatar while it loads the new one instead of leaving the old one until its done.\n\nI agree that its not the best thing to look at but I'm not sure what good replacement would be for it since, the other default avatars aren't that great either, making someone invisible while changing avatar just doesn't sound right (maybe it would be abused somehow), the icon might be ok-ish (can't picture it in my head but just don't make it 2D please).\n\nMaybe the ideal solution would be to go back as it was before, where it doesn't change the avatar the person has until it loads the new one, and just keep the loading bar on top of the avatar to let people know that a new avatar is being loaded.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
